  "effectiveDate": "2022-12-17",
  "historyNote": "#6057-B, eff 6-30-95 (from Env-A 607.01); ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03 (formerly Env-A 615.02); ss by #10000, eff 10-1-11; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
